ATTRIBUTION
-----------
The knowledge base synthesizes ideas from the "storytelling with data" (SWD) body of
work. All text is written in our own words. No source text, images, or files are
redistributed. Examples and benchmarks use original, fictional scenarios (D-017).

Primary sources (cited by ID in each card; see 10_sources/SOURCES.md):
  * Cole Nussbaumer Knaflic and the storytelling with data team — SWD + AI Primer
    (including an excerpt from "storytelling with data: before & after", Wiley, 2025)
    and the "AI for data storytelling" article series on storytellingwithdata.com
  * Alex Velez — "using AI without giving up control" (editable PowerPoint charts)
  * Amy Esselman — "apply color thoughtfully in your graphs"; "give each point its own view"

